# EXPECT: A class needs a definition
# A class of the enterprise domain structure with a label but no definition.
@prefix o4de: <http://www.zt4swe.io/o4de#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
o4de:BadUndefinedClass a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Bad undefined class" .
